<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r09r0202_cleaningm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　ダンボールの　やま……▼
なかに　はいっているのは
もう　うれない　でんかせいひん　だと▼
おきっぱなしも　もったいないし
だれか　うまく　つかえないのかね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T05:28:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　ダンボールの　山……▼
中に　入っているのは
もう　売れない　電化製品だと▼
置きっぱなしも　もったいないし
だれか　うまく　使えないのかね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T05:28:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ロトムのフォルムチェンジ関連は
　wb_rotom.gmmで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>CLEANINGM
清掃員</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r09r0202_mission_add_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フフフ……　きみさ
なんの　へんてつもない▽
オボンのみを▽
１０００円と　いわれたら　かう？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:07:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……　きみさ
なんの　変哲もない▽
オボンのみを▽
１０００円と　いわれたら　買う？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:07:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・フェス用システムフラグがOFF
・はい/いいえの選択肢
　はい　→mission_add_02
　いいえ→mission_add_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:09:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GLASSES</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:47:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r09r0202_mission_add_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フフフ……
きみ　いいね▼
まあ　どちらでも　いいんだ
きみが　なっとくの　いく▽
ねだんだと　かんじたなら　ね▼
かいものって　そういう　もんだろう？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……
きみ　いいね▼
まあ　どちらでも　いいんだ
きみが　納得の　いく▽
値段だと　感じたなら　ね▼
買い物って　そういう　もんだろう？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:07:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:47:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GLASSES</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:47:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r09r0202_mission_add_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フフフ……
そうだろうね▼
まあ　どちらでも　いいんだが
なっとくが　いかないなら　かわない▽
かいものって　そういう　もんだよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……
そうだろうね▼
まあ　どちらでも　いいんだが
納得が　いかないなら　買わない▽
買い物って　そういう　もんだよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:08:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T03:47:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
