				Time="2011-11-21T03:48:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……
大事なのは　自分が▽
納得したか　どうかさ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T13:08:20" />
